				<i>rainy</i>, <i>rain-</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Auster,</span>”
				<i>rainbringing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 429</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Haedi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					9, 668</span></i>
			: 
